fcitx5-ngosen for Debian
------------------------

Installing this package does not change the session of any user. Two steps
may still be needed before Vietnamese typing works:

1. Make fcitx5 the input method framework. im-config prefers IBus when both
   are installed, so run this as the user and log in again:

     im-config -n fcitx5

2. Add Ngó Sen to the fcitx5 input method list. fcitx5 adds it by itself the
   first time it runs on a Vietnamese desktop (LANG=vi_VN.UTF-8). Otherwise
   open "Fcitx 5 Configuration" (fcitx5-configtool), add "Ngó Sen", and apply.

The one-line installer from https://github.com/ngosen/ngosen does both steps.
